# SEO (launch)

Professional **launch** SEO for this stack. Ongoing content/link marketing stays Out of Scope unless the user expands it.

Skill: `seo-site` (implement during build · audit before Pre-ship).

## Hard locks

| Lock | Rule |
|---|---|
| Metadata | Every public route → Next.js `generateMetadata` / `metadata` from the content source: `src/content/*.ts` (landing/multipage) or Sanity `seo` + `siteSettings.defaultSeo` (cms/shop) — never hardcoded page titles in components |
| Crawl | `src/app/sitemap.ts` + `src/app/robots.ts` · production `metadataBase` = live site URL |
| Canonical | Absolute canonical per indexable page |
| Studio (cms/shop) | Standalone at `<slug>.sanity.studio`, not part of the site · draft/preview paths (OpenNext only) → `noindex, nofollow` |
| Schema | JSON-LD only (`application/ld+json`) — never Microdata/RDFa |
| NAP | Footer / contact / LocalBusiness schema match `src/content/site.ts` / `siteSettings` |
| Images | Meaningful `alt` from the content source · decorative → empty alt |
| Headings | One `h1` per page · logical `h2`+ · no skipping for style |

## Required JSON-LD (minimum)

- **Organization** or **LocalBusiness** (if NAP / service-area business)
- **WebSite** (SearchAction only if site search exists)
- **BreadcrumbList** on nested routes

Do **not** add FAQPage (restricted) or HowTo (deprecated) for commercial sites.

## Content fields

Shapes live in `plan.md` Content model: `seo` per page module or Sanity `seo` object, plus a site default (`site.ts` / `siteSettings.defaultSeo`); page SEO falls back to the default.

Title ≤ ~60 chars intent · description ≤ ~155 · unique per indexable URL.

## Never

- Ship without sitemap/robots on a public host
- Index `/studio`, preview, or thank-you/spam sinks without reason
- Duplicate titles/descriptions across routes
- Keyword stuffing or thin location-page farms (warn at many near-duplicate locale pages)
- Recommend FID — use **INP** with LCP / CLS (`design.mdc` perf floor)
- Invent SEO copy that breaks Copy lock — flag gaps; don’t invent slogans

## Do

- Semantic HTML (`main`, `nav`, `article` where it fits) — helps SEO and a11y
- Internal links: every indexable page reachable from nav/footer or in-content
- hreflang only when `plan.md` languages > 1
- OG/Twitter tags via Next metadata API (image from `ogImage` or default)
- After routes exist → run `seo-site` before ticking Pre-ship SEO gate
